{
"file": 861,
"paths": [
"d008/d083/f018"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "06dc6941",
"en_raw": "Nobody followed you, right?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "ad6d1d22",
"en_raw": "No, I think it's fine"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "a760544f",
"en_raw": "...I'm not suspected"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "617b23f4",
"en_raw": "that much"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "366402ad",
"en_raw": "Good"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "760f6a8f",
"en_raw": "...So it's Kume after all?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "868a2ef4",
"en_raw": "...I'll be honest because it's you"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "bfc1ec8b",
"en_raw": "It was me"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "f080b7c4",
"en_raw": "who did that to the cat"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "3a3db330",
"en_raw": "They say it's a kind of Kodoku curse"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "c73a1f75",
"en_raw": "A very strong curse"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "32fc57fe",
"en_raw": "that can apparently kill many people"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "e568921f",
"en_raw": "...It was Kume who invited you"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "d7e1e0b2",
"en_raw": "...Yeah"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "384c4f23",
"en_raw": "...Yuasa and the others got scared"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "bfb820d9",
"en_raw": "and I thought if it would"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "ecfda855",
"en_raw": "cheer Kume up"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "2d586048",
"en_raw": "I don't like Yuasa either"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "39d6a0a5",
"en_raw": "so I cooperated, but..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "47968f16",
"en_raw": "Did you really try to kill the kitten?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "2a1c7387",
"en_raw": "Nope"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "66f239ff",
"en_raw": "I was going to"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "232ed39f",
"en_raw": "show Kume only the doing"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "c783831e",
"en_raw": "and then rescue it"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "82b74d4f",
"en_raw": "Of course!"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "10594585",
"en_raw": "But before I knew it"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "41f55217",
"en_raw": "the jar's contents had vanished..."
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "85e8406a",
"en_raw": "It's not strange"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "7fb05f64",
"en_raw": "We took it out"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "d0d341e0",
"en_raw": "Yeah, and that"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "c8dc7334",
"en_raw": "reassured me a bit, but..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "0cab6777",
"en_raw": "...But Kume"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "c028c0cd",
"en_raw": "today"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "da913cd0",
"en_raw": "the fact that the curse isn't working"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "7a73ee0b",
"en_raw": "is strange, he started saying"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "d4686e08",
"en_raw": "So?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "98fd8719",
"en_raw": "The sacrifice isn't enough, he says"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "212f50e4",
"en_raw": "So"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "9e76be5f",
"en_raw": "if we leave it as is"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "6f74bcc7",
"en_raw": "the curse will"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "a321c3fd",
"en_raw": "come back to us!"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "912bb3cd",
"en_raw": "No way!?"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "e586760b",
"en_raw": "I somehow"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "f739dace",
"en_raw": "got scared of Kume"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "5cb6dff1",
"en_raw": "Yuasa or whoever,"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "67d0a7b2",
"en_raw": "doesn't matter"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "7ba8b88a",
"en_raw": "so I said let's stop"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "511e3053",
"en_raw": "this stuff"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "9a4434a5",
"en_raw": "Then he glared and asked"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "ede25bd2",
"en_raw": "if I don't believe him..."
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "d4686e08",
"en_raw": "So?"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "5aed2e6c",
"en_raw": "...I have to do it again"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "9261c980",
"en_raw": "I'm supposed to"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "95a9a2e7",
"en_raw": "But I can't stand it anymore"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "b529c219",
"en_raw": "Such a cruel thing"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "2ad8180c",
"en_raw": "Could you do it for me?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "13639748",
"en_raw": "Rescue the kitten once more"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "5f699339",
"en_raw": "Y-yeah, got it"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "ed2b3d8d",
"en_raw": "If you rescue it"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "1aa0fc9f",
"en_raw": "come here again tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "dbdc9f4b",
"en_raw": "I'll be waiting"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "8b5eb15f",
"en_raw": "Fine"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "ea9234eb",
"en_raw": "Sorry, it's about time"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "0a4d228c",
"en_raw": "I have to go"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "6f994f51",
"en_raw": "Hey, I'm counting on you"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "fa561eb2",
"en_raw": "It's not like I like"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "7f28f079",
"en_raw": "lending a hand"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "8b5eb15f",
"en_raw": "Fine"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "a3705afe",
"en_raw": "...Oh, and don't call me"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "2537d911",
"en_raw": "it's dangerous"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "8b5eb15f",
"en_raw": "Fine"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "73aa1b20",
"en_raw": "See you"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "7c4e7b12",
"en_raw": "...Can't talk now"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "bf07f1f5",
"en_raw": "If... you'll listen"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "ff06ff0c",
"en_raw": "I'll wait again tomorrow..."
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "5176dd58",
"en_raw": "Segawa...?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "57f9d44d",
"en_raw": "Plan changed:"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "30444046",
"en_raw": "wait behind the school..."
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "34d61100",
"en_raw": "Come alone, for sure...?"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "ef96e33f",
"en_raw": "(A bird...)"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "a3e0f91a",
"en_raw": "(That startled me...)"
}
]
}